    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Click each button on the web app and watch what changes on the screen. Record your observations in your Activity Guide.\r\n\r\n2. Open the JavaScript file `script.js`.\r\n\r\n3. In your Activity Guide, map *at least three* of the buttons you tested to its:\r\n\r\n   * **selector** (what's being listened to),\r\n   * **handler** (what runs on click),\r\n   * **DOM update** (what changes on screen).\r\n\r\n4. Ask AI about anything unfamiliar. Use these frames (edit to fit):\r\n\r\n   * \"What does `addEventListener('click')` do?\"\r\n\r\n   * \"What does `textContent` change in this app?\"\r\n\r\n   * \"What does `style.display = 'block'` do?\"\r\n\r\n",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>Plant Care Helper</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>Plant Care Helper</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"buttonMenu\">\n    <button id=\"buttonWater\">Water Plant</button>\n    <button id=\"buttonSun\">Add Sunlight</button>\n    <button id=\"buttonFertilizer\">Add Fertilizer</button>\n    <button id=\"buttonSoil\">Check Soil</button>\n    <button id=\"buttonFact\">Plant Fact</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div id=\"stage\">\n    <img\n      id=\"plantNormal\"\n      src=\"plant-normal.png\"\n      alt=\"A small plant in a terracotta pot.\"\n    >\n    <img\n      id=\"plantSunny\"\n      src=\"plant-sunny.png\"\n      alt=\"A small plant basking in sunlight.\"\n      hidden\n    >\n    <img\n      id=\"sprout\"\n      src=\"sprout.png\"\n      alt=\"A new sprout with two bright green leaves.\"\n      hidden\n    >\n  </div>\n\n  <div id=\"output\">\n    Click a button to see what changes here.\n  </div>\n\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": true,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "styles.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "body {\n  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  background-color: #f5f9f6;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  color: #14532d;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.buttonMenu {\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  display: inline-block;\n  margin: 4px;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background-color: #d1fae5;\n  color: #064e3b;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n#stage {\n  margin: 20px auto;\n}\n\n\n/* Show only the normal plant on page load */\n#plantNormal {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* Hide the sunny plant and sprout initially */\n#plantSunny {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n#sprout {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n/* Shared image styles */\n#stage img {\n  width: 180px;\n  height: auto;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n/* Output box */\n#output {\n  display: block;\n  margin: 20px auto;\n  max-width: 500px;\n  min-height: 80px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 2px solid #bbf7d0;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  color: #14532d;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// Water Button\ndocument.getElementById(\"buttonWater\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n  \n  document.getElementById(\"plantNormal\").style.display = \"block\";\n  document.getElementById(\"plantSunny\").style.display = \"none\";\n  document.getElementById(\"sprout\").style.display = \"none\";\n  \n  document.getElementById(\"output\").textContent = \"You watered the plant. It looks refreshed!\";\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").style.backgroundColor = \"#e0f2fe\";\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").style.borderColor = \"#93c5fd\";\n});\n\n\n// Sun Button\ndocument.getElementById(\"buttonSun\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n  document.getElementById(\"plantNormal\").style.display = \"none\";\n  document.getElementById(\"plantSunny\").style.display = \"block\";\n  document.getElementById(\"sprout\").style.display = \"none\";\n  \n  document.getElementById(\"output\").textContent = \"Sunshine added. The plant is soaking it up!\";\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").style.backgroundColor = \"#ffffff\";\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").style.borderColor = \"#bbf7d0\";\n});\n\n\n// Fertilizer Button\ndocument.getElementById(\"buttonFertilizer\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n  document.getElementById(\"plantNormal\").style.display = \"none\";\n  document.getElementById(\"plantSunny\").style.display = \"none\";\n  document.getElementById(\"sprout\").style.display = \"block\";\n  \n  document.getElementById(\"output\").textContent = \"Nutrients added. A new sprout appears!\";\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").style.backgroundColor = \"#ffffff\";\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").style.borderColor = \"#bbf7d0\";\n});\n\n\n// Soil Button\ndocument.getElementById(\"buttonSoil\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").textContent = \"Soil check: Moist and healthy.\";\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").style.backgroundColor = \"#ede9d5\";\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").style.borderColor = \"#92400e\";\n});\n\n\n// Fact Button\ndocument.getElementById(\"buttonFact\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").textContent = \"Plant fact: Most houseplants prefer bright, indirect light and consistent watering.\";\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").style.backgroundColor = \"#f0fdf4\";\n  document.getElementById(\"output\").style.borderColor = \"#86efac\";\n});\n\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
